"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":{\"start\":20,\"end\":80}},\"motion_fx_rotateZ_speed\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1,\"sizes\":[]},\"motion_fx_rotateZ_affectedRange\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":{\"start\":0,\"end\":100}},\"motion_fx_scale_speed\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":4,\"sizes\":[]},\"motion_fx_scale_range\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":{\"start\":20,\"end\":80}},\"motion_fx_mouseTrack_speed\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1,\"sizes\":[]},\"motion_fx_tilt_speed\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":4,\"sizes\":[]},\"content_width\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"253a369\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"tabs\":[{\"tab_title\":\"Do you need organization?\",\"tab_content\":\"<p>Yes! Beyond basic cleaning, MyClean also offers <strong data-start=\\\"229\\\" data-end=\\\"266\\\">organization and tidying services<\\/strong> to help you declutter your living or working space. Our professional cleaners can arrange items, optimize storage, and create a neat environment to make your daily life more efficient.<\\/p>\",\"_id\":\"e84b9c8\"},{\"tab_title\":\"What pricing plan best for you?\",\"tab_content\":\"<p data-start=\\\"499\\\" data-end=\\\"606\\\">We offer <strong data-start=\\\"522\\\" data-end=\\\"550\\\">flexible pricing options<\\/strong> based on the frequency and type of cleaning required.<\\/p><ul data-start=\\\"607\\\" data-end=\\\"974\\\"><li data-start=\\\"607\\\" data-end=\\\"740\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"609\\\" data-end=\\\"635\\\">One-Time \\/ Deep Clean:<\\/strong> Ideal for a thorough refresh, especially after events or long intervals without professional cleaning.<\\/li><li data-start=\\\"741\\\" data-end=\\\"865\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"743\\\" data-end=\\\"784\\\">Recurring Cleanings (Weekly\\/Monthly):<\\/strong> Perfect for those who want a consistently tidy space at a <strong data-start=\\\"843\\\" data-end=\\\"862\\\">discounted rate<\\/strong>.<\\/li><li data-start=\\\"866\\\" data-end=\\\"974\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"868\\\" data-end=\\\"898\\\">Office \\/ Commercial Plans:<\\/strong> Tailored packages for businesses seeking regular upkeep of their workspace.<\\/li><\\/ul><p data-start=\\\"976\\\" data-end=\\\"1062\\\">Feel free to <a href=\\\"#\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" data-start=\\\"989\\\" data-end=\\\"1004\\\">contact us<\\/a> or explore our <a href=\\\"#\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" data-start=\\\"1020\\\" data-end=\\\"1037\\\">Booking Page<\\/a> to see detailed pricing.<\\/p>\",\"_id\":\"30a8e92\"},{\"tab_title\":\"Why choose us and not others?\",\"tab_content\":\"<li data-start=\\\"1119\\\" data-end=\\\"1229\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1121\\\" data-end=\\\"1154\\\">Trusted &amp; Certified Cleaners:<\\/strong> Our cleaners undergo strict background checks and professional training.<\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1230\\\" data-end=\\\"1331\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1232\\\" data-end=\\\"1261\\\">Online Booking &amp; Payment:<\\/strong> Effortlessly schedule appointments and pay online, reducing hassle.<\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1332\\\" data-end=\\\"1451\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1334\\\" data-end=\\\"1359\\\">Eco-Friendly Options:<\\/strong> Choose sustainable cleaning products (optional) for an environmentally conscious service.<\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1452\\\" data-end=\\\"1578\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1454\\\" data-end=\\\"1480\\\">Flexible Rescheduling:<\\/strong> Need to change your plans? We\\u2019ve got you covered with easy modification or cancellation policies.<\\/li>\",\"_id\":\"6029267\"},{\"tab_title\":\"Should you trust professional cleaner?\",\"tab_content\":\"<p>Absolutely! Professional cleaners bring <strong data-start=\\\"1685\\\" data-end=\\\"1735\\\">expertise, efficiency, and attention to detail<\\/strong>. At MyClean, all cleaners are <strong data-start=\\\"1766\\\" data-end=\\\"1801\\\">background-checked and verified<\\/strong> to ensure safety and reliability. This means you can confidently leave the cleaning tasks to our pros and enjoy a spotless, comfortable space.<\\/p>\",\"_id\":\"c63635b\"},{\"tab_title\":\"Not happy with service & want to complain?\",\"tab_content\":\"<p>Your satisfaction is our top priority. If you\\u2019re not 100% happy, please <strong data-start=\\\"2086\\\" data-end=\\\"2114\\\">contact our support team<\\/strong> within 24 hours of your appointment. We\\u2019ll work with you to <strong data-start=\\\"2175\\\" data-end=\\\"2197\\\">resolve any issues<\\/strong>\\u2014whether through a <strong data-start=\\\"2216\\\" data-end=\\\"2233\\\">free re-clean<\\/strong>, a <strong data-start=\\\"2237\\\" data-end=\\\"2249\\\">discount<\\/strong>, or other suitable remedies\\u2014to ensure you get the service you deserve.<\\/p>\",\"_id\":\"f11e3bb\"},{\"tab_title\":\"Do we have good service record?\",\"tab_content\":\"<p data-start=\\\"2367\\\" data-end=\\\"2618\\\">Yes! We\\u2019re proud of our <strong data-start=\\\"2405\\\" data-end=\\\"2441\\\">high customer satisfaction rates<\\/strong> and consistent <strong data-start=\\\"2457\\\" data-end=\\\"2478\\\">five-star reviews<\\/strong>. You can check our <a data-start=\\\"2498\\\" data-end=\\\"2515\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" href=\\\"#\\\">Testimonials<\\/a> page to see what other customers are saying, or feel free to ask our support team for more references.<\\/p>\",\"_id\":\"2b1aaca\"},{\"tab_title\":\"How to keep the cleaning task intact?\",\"tab_content\":\"<p data-start=\\\"2669\\\" data-end=\\\"2736\\\">To maintain the results of a professional cleaning:<\\/p><ol data-start=\\\"2737\\\" data-end=\\\"3057\\\"><li data-start=\\\"2737\\\" data-end=\\\"2788\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"2740\\\" data-end=\\\"2757\\\">Tidy up daily<\\/strong> to prevent clutter build-up.<\\/li><li data-start=\\\"2789\\\" data-end=\\\"2858\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"2792\\\" data-end=\\\"2825\\\">Schedule regular appointments<\\/strong> if you want consistent upkeep.<\\/li><li data-start=\\\"2859\\\" data-end=\\\"2933\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"2862\\\" data-end=\\\"2889\\\">Store cleaning supplies<\\/strong> in accessible places for quick touch-ups.<\\/li><li data-start=\\\"2934\\\" data-end=\\\"3057\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"2937\\\" data-end=\\\"2952\\\">Communicate<\\/strong> with your cleaner about any specific needs or ongoing issues, so they can address them in future visits.<\\/li><\\/ol>\",\"_id\":\"c2fd70c\"},{\"tab_title\":\"How to get our service booking?\",\"tab_content\":\"<ol data-start=\\\"3116\\\" data-end=\\\"3367\\\"><li data-start=\\\"3116\\\" data-end=\\\"3155\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"3119\\\" data-end=\\\"3141\\\">Register or Log In<\\/strong> to MyClean.<\\/li><li data-start=\\\"3156\\\" data-end=\\\"3213\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"3159\\\" data-end=\\\"3186\\\">Choose a Service &amp; Time<\\/strong> that fits your schedule.<\\/li><li data-start=\\\"3214\\\" data-end=\\\"3282\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"3217\\\" data-end=\\\"3244\\\">Complete Secure Payment<\\/strong> via Stripe, PayPal, or credit card.<\\/li><li data-start=\\\"3283\\\" data-end=\\\"3367\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"3286\\\" data-end=\\\"3310\\\">Receive Confirmation<\\/strong>\\u2014your cleaner will arrive on the scheduled date and time!<\\/li><\\/ol><p data-start=\\\"3369\\\" data-end=\\\"3470\\\">If you have any trouble booking online, you can also contact our <strong data-start=\\\"3434\\\" data-end=\\\"3454\\\">customer support<\\/strong> for assistance.<\\/p>\",\"_id\":\"73a790f\"}],\"icon\":\"fa fa-angle-right\",\"icon_active\":\"fa fa-angle-down\",\"border_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1},\"border_color\":\"rgba(221,221,221,0.63)\",\"title_background\":\"#ffffff\",\"title_color\":\"#282828\",\"tab_active_color\":\"#7baa7e\",\"title_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"title_typography_font_family\":\"Open Sans\",\"title_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"rem\",\"size\":\"\"},\"title_typography_font_weight\":\"500\",\"title_typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":25},\"title_typography_letter_spacing\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\"