\/strong>, you agree to the following:<\\/p><ul data-start=\\\"352\\\" data-end=\\\"1022\\\"><li data-start=\\\"352\\\" data-end=\\\"481\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"354\\\" data-end=\\\"373\\\">Fair Use Policy<\\/strong>: Users must provide <strong data-start=\\\"394\\\" data-end=\\\"422\\\">accurate booking details<\\/strong> and ensure access to the premises at the scheduled time.<\\/li><li data-start=\\\"482\\\" data-end=\\\"624\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"484\\\" data-end=\\\"525\\\">Booking Modifications &amp; Cancellations<\\/strong>: Cancellations must be made <strong data-start=\\\"554\\\" data-end=\\\"577\\\">24 hours in advance<\\/strong> to be eligible for a refund or rescheduling.<\\/li><li data-start=\\\"625\\\" data-end=\\\"769\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"627\\\" data-end=\\\"648\\\">Payment &amp; Refunds<\\/strong>: Payments are <strong data-start=\\\"663\\\" data-end=\\\"713\\\">securely processed online via Stripe or PayPal<\\/strong>. Refunds are only provided under specific conditions.<\\/li><li data-start=\\\"770\\\" data-end=\\\"906\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"772\\\" data-end=\\\"795\\\">Service Limitations<\\/strong>: Our cleaners have the right to <strong data-start=\\\"828\\\" data-end=\\\"847\\\">decline service<\\/strong> if an environment is deemed unsafe or outside our scope.<\\/li><li data-start=\\\"907\\\" data-end=\\\"1022\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"909\\\" data-end=\\\"931\\\">Dispute Resolution<\\/strong>: Any issues regarding the service must be reported within <strong data-start=\\\"990\\\" data-end=\\\"1002\\\">24 hours<\\/strong> after completion.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"text_color\":\"#727982\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Hind\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":15},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":26},\"typography_letter_spacing\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0},\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"1\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\"