ence<\\/strong> and customer support.<\\/li><\\/ul><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1717\\\" data-end=\\\"1905\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1719\\\" data-end=\\\"1745\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1719\\\" data-end=\\\"1742\\\">Third-Party Sharing<\\/strong>:<\\/p><ul data-start=\\\"1748\\\" data-end=\\\"1905\\\"><li data-start=\\\"1748\\\" data-end=\\\"1781\\\">We <strong data-start=\\\"1753\\\" data-end=\\\"1768\\\">DO NOT sell<\\/strong> user data.<\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1784\\\" data-end=\\\"1905\\\">Limited data is shared only with <strong data-start=\\\"1819\\\" data-end=\\\"1848\\\">trusted service providers<\\/strong> (e.g., professional cleaners) for service fulfillment.<\\/li><\\/ul><\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"text_color\":\"#727982\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Hind\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":15},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":26},\"typography_letter_spacing\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"103a8e3\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":33,\"width\":{\"size\":null,\"unit\":\"%\"},\"background_position\":\"top center\",\"background_repeat\":\"no-repeat\",\"background_overlay_background\":\"classic\",\"background_overlay_color\":\"rgba(34,34,34,0)\",\"background_overlay_opacity\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0.02},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"60\",\"right\":\"40\",\"bottom\":\"70\",\"left\":\"40\",\"isLinked\":false},\"flex_gap\":{\"size\":5,\"column\":\"5\",\"row\":\"5\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#ffffff\",\"background_overlay_image\":{\"id\":\"113\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/myclean.168chinesetcw.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/03\\/text-file-font.png\"},\"background_overlay_position\":\"center right\",\"background_overlay_repeat\":\"no-repeat\",\"background_overlay_size\":\"auto\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\"