04-12 02:31:33','',0,'http://localhost/wordpress/?page_id=9',0,'page','',0),(306,1,'2025-04-01 02:25:00','2025-04-01 02:25:00','<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<!-- wp:button -->\n<a></a>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->		\n					<h1>Make cleaning easier and make life better!</h1>				\n		<p>Book easily online, enjoy star-rated cleaning, and revitalize your space!</p>		\n					<a href=\"http://dev.my-clean.top/register/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M464 32H48C21.49 32 0 53.49 0 80v352c0 26.51 21.49 48 48 48h416c26.51 0 48-21.49 48-48V80c0-26.51-21.49-48-48-48zm-6 400H54a6 6 0 0 1-6-6V86a6 6 0 0 1 6-6h404a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v340a6 6 0 0 1-6 6zm-42-92v24c0 6.627-5.373 12-12 12H204c-6.627 0-12-5.373-12-12v-24c0-6.627 5.373-12 12-12h200c6.627 0 12 5.373 12 12zm0-96v24c0 6.627-5.373 12-12 12H204c-6.627 0-12-5.373-12-12v-24c0-6.627 5.373-12 12-12h200c6.627 0 12 5.373 12 12zm0-96v24c0 6.627-5.373 12-12 12H204c-6.627 0-12-5.373-12-12v-24c0-6.627 5.373-12 12-12h200c6.627 0 12 5.373 12 12zm-252 12c0 19.882-16.118 36-36 36s-36-16.118-36-36 16.118-36 36-36 36 16.118 36 36zm0 96c0 19.882-16.118 36-36 36s-36-16.118-36-36 16.118-36 36-36 36 16.118 36 36zm0 96c0 19.882-16.118 36-36 36s-36-16.118-36-36 16.118-36 36-36 36 16.118 36 36z\"></path></svg>			\n									Register Now\n					</a>\n					<h3>How it Works</h3>				\n					<figure><img width=\"67\" height=\"60\" src=\"http://dev.my-clean.top/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/icon-1.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Choose Your Service</h3><p>Choose the perfect cleaning service for your needs. We offer home cleaning, deep cleaning, office cleaning, and eco-friendly options.\nOur professional cleaners ensure a spotless and fresh environment.\n</p>				\n					<figure><img width=\"36\" height=\"60\" src=\"http://dev.my-clean.top/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/icon-2.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Schedule Your Cleaning</h3><p>Pick a convenient date and time using our real-time booking system.\nEnjoy flexible scheduling, including same-day and emergency cleaning.Flexible modification or cancellation—if your plans change, we’ve got you covered.</p>				\n					<figure><img width=\"48\" height=\"60\" src=\"http://dev.my-clean.top/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/icon-7.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Relax & Enjoy</h3><p>Sit back and relax while our certified cleaners transform your space.\nAfter the service, you can rate and review your cleaner to help us maintain top quality.</p>				\n															<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1440\" src=\"http://dev.my-clean.top/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/apartment-beverage-bottle-544112.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://dev.my-clean.top/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/apartment-beverage-bottle-544112.jpg 1920w, http://dev.my-clean.top/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/apartment-beverage-bottle-544112-300x225.jpg 300w, http://dev.my-clean.top/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/apartment-beverage-bottle-544112-1024x768.jpg 1024w, http://dev.my-clean.top/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/apartment-beverage-bottle-544112-768x576.jpg 768w, http://dev.my-clean.top/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/apartment-beverage-bottle-544112-1536x1152.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" />															\n					<h3>Our Guarantee</h3>				\n		<p>MyClean is committed to providing you with high-quality, reliable, professional cleaning services.<br />All cleaners on our platform are strictly audited and certified to ensure professional and safe services. With a simple online booking system, you can flexibly choose the time and service type that best suits you and easily manage your cleaning needs.</p>		\n							<ul>\n							<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>						\n										All cleaners are audited and certified by the administrator\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>						\n										Flexible reservation and cancellation policies to accommodate changes in plans at any time\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>						\n										Safe and convenient online payment\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>						\n										Check out our FAQ for more info on cancellations and refunds\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n					<h3>Starting at just $30 </h3>				\n		<p>You can enjoy professional, safe and convenient cleaning services.<br />MyClean provides you with flexible online booking, convenient payment methods, and 100% satisfaction guarantee to make your life easier.Secure online payment via Stripe/PayPal, instant e-receipt provided.We offer green cleaning products for a healthier home and planet.</p>		\n					<a href=\"http://dev.my-clean.top/booking-page/\">\n									Contact Now\n					</a>\n					<h3>We specialize In...</h3>				\n															<img src=\"http://dev.my-clean.top/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/nik-lanus-41808-unsplash-r2gkmrv13rlod0dxclqir3lh5fn5t61fv5r4c1xfu8.jpg\" title=\"nik-lanus-41808-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"nik-lanus-41808-unsplash.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h4>Eco-friendly cleaning</h4>				\n															<img src=\"http://dev.my-clean.top/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/abstract-blur-business-334979-r2gkmxi28rteao5qfo6a6268pqvd3cntvxo17pp2sw.jpg\" title=\"abstract-blur-business-334979.jpg\" alt=\"abstract-blur-business-334979.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h4>Closets</h4>				\n															<img src=\"http://dev.my-clean.top/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/bazaar-bottles-business-15964-r2gkn353ds148bxjiqm1l0r0a23kdja7wpky3dgprk.jpg\" title=\"bazaar-bottles-business-15964.jpg\" alt=\"bazaar-bottles-business-15964.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h4>Organization</h4>				\n															<img width=\"800\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://dev.my-clean.top/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/service-6.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://dev.my-clean.top/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/service-6.jpg 800w, http://dev.my-clean.top/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/service-6-300x225.jpg 300w, http://dev.my-clean.top/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/service-6-768x576.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />															\n					<h4>Kitchens</h4>				\n															<img src=\"http://dev.my-clean.top/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/bath-bathroom-bathtub-534116-r2gkncjha4dzgfjvzuob9ydm7wt8iibja03sw52s1c.jpg\" title=\"bath-bathroom-bathtub-534116.jpg\" alt=\"bath-bathroom-bathtub-534116.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h4>Bathrooms</h4>				\n															<img src