r it’s for your home or office, our trained professionals ensure every space is cleaned with <strong data-start=\"284\" data-end=\"306\">care and precision</strong>.</p>		\n							<ul>\n							<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>						\n										Certified & Background-Checked Cleaners\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>						\n										Convenient & Flexible Booking\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>						\n										Eco-Friendly Cleaning\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>						\n										Secure & Easy Payment\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>						\n										Satisfaction Guaranteed\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n					<h3>We specialize In...</h3>				\n					<figure><img width=\"36\" height=\"60\" src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/icon-2.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Home Cleaning</h3><p>Perfect for keeping your living space fresh and tidy. </p>				\n					<figure><img width=\"50\" height=\"60\" src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/icon-4.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3> Deep Cleaning</h3><p>Intensive, thorough cleaning service covering every corner of your space. Recommended for spring cleans, moving houses, or special events.</p>				\n					<figure><img width=\"67\" height=\"60\" src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/icon-1.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Office Cleaning</h3><p>Reliable and professional cleaning for office spaces, ensuring a tidy and productive working environment for you and your team.</p>				\n								<figure><img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/clean-decoration-home-6412-r2gkmla5rxco3qnhf0w4rn98zqjlbabbi96pz4771s.jpg\" alt=\"clean-decoration-home-6412.jpg\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/bath-bathroom-bathtub-534116-r2gkncjha4dzgfjvzuob9ydm7wt8iibja03sw52s1c.jpg\" alt=\"bath-bathroom-bathtub-534116.jpg\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/nik-lanus-41808-unsplash-1-r2himx09obd0iy917qv806wfyhzyahsw63rscyvofk.jpg\" alt=\"nik-lanus-41808-unsplash-1.jpg\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/bazaar-bottles-business-15964-r2gkn353ds148bxjiqm1l0r0a23kdja7wpky3dgprk.jpg\" alt=\"bazaar-bottles-business-15964.jpg\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/abstract-blur-business-334979-r2gkmxi28rteao5qfo6a6268pqvd3cntvxo17pp2sw.jpg\" alt=\"abstract-blur-business-334979.jpg\" /></figure>			\n					<figure><img width=\"48\" height=\"60\" src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/icon-7.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Organization & Decluttering</h3><p>Professional organizing services to help declutter and optimize your storage spaces, improving efficiency and reducing stress.</p>				\n					<figure><img width=\"55\" height=\"60\" src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/icon-3.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3> Green Cleaning</h3><p>Environmentally friendly cleaning services using safe, biodegradable products to protect your home and our planet.</p>				\n					<figure><img width=\"57\" height=\"60\" src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/icon-6.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>LAUNDRY SERVICES</h3><p>Professional laundry care including washing, drying, folding, and ironing, giving you more time for the things you love.</p>','About Us','','publish','closed','closed','','about-us','','','2025-03-07 01:21:16','2025-03-07 01:21:16','',0,'http://localhost/wordpress/?page_id=44',0,'page','',0),(45,1,'2025-03-06 11:26:57','2025-03-06 11:26:57','','About Us','','inherit','closed','closed','','44-revision-v1','','','2025-03-06 11:26:57','2025-03-06 11:26:57','',44,'http://localhost/wordpress/?p=45',0,'revision','',0),(46,1,'2025-03-06 11:27:15','2025-03-06 11:27:15','','About Us','','inherit','closed','closed','','44-revision-v1','','','2025-03-06 11:27:15','2025-03-06 11:27:15','',44,'http://localhost/wordpress/?p=46',0,'revis