 elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna.</p>		\n															<img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/girl-people-landscape-sun-38554-r2himg2xz2z8oq4sm30wg6pazcko3s17ajtjyddlf4.jpeg\" title=\"girl-people-landscape-sun-38554.jpeg\" alt=\"girl-people-landscape-sun-38554.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n															<img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/clean-decoration-home-6412-r2gkmla0nqgs9b2djqm4ybs5elr5hornzowo758t08.jpg\" title=\"clean-decoration-home-6412.jpg\" alt=\"clean-decoration-home-6412.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h3>Fast, Friendly Service</h3>				\n		Sed ut perspiciatis unde omnis iste natus error sit voluptatem accusantium doloremque laudantium, totam rem aperiam, eaque ipsa quae ab illo inventore veritatis et quasi architecto beatae vitae dicta sunt explicabo. 		\n							<ul>\n							<li>\n										Vetted and background-checked professionals\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										Backed by the Handy Happiness Guarantee.\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										 Friendly 24/7 customer service\n									</li>\n								<li>\n										 Affordable, upfront pricing\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n					<a href=\"#\">\n									Book Now\n					</a>','Rates','','publish','closed','closed','','rates','','','2025-03-18 04:14:18','2025-03-18 04:14:18','',0,'http://localhost/wordpress/?elementor_library=rates',0,'elementor_library','',0),(51,1,'2025-03-06 11:28:52','2025-03-06 11:28:52','<h2>Popular Questions</h2>				\n															<svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"></path></svg>\n								<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M143 352.3L7 216.3c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l22.6-22.6c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l96.4 96.4 96.4-96.4c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l22.6 22.6c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9l-136 136c-9.2 9.4-24.4 9.4-33.8 0z\"></path></svg>\n												<a tabindex=\"0\">Do you need organization?</a>\n					<p>Yes! Beyond basic cleaning, MyClean also offers <strong data-start=\"229\" data-end=\"266\">organization and tidying services</strong> to help you declutter your living or working space. Our professional cleaners can arrange items, optimize storage, and create a neat environment to make your daily life more efficient.</p>\n															<svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"></path></svg>\n								<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M143 352.3L7 216.3c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l22.6-22.6c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l96.4 96.4 96.4-96.4c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l22.6 22.6c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9l-136 136c-9.2 9.4-24.4 9.4-33.8 0z\"></path></svg>\n												<a tabindex=\"0\">What pricing plan best for you?</a>\n					<p data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"606\">We offer <strong data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"550\">flexible pricing options</strong> based on the frequency and type of cleaning required.</p><ul data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"974\"><li data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"740\"><strong data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"635\">One-Time / Deep Clean:</strong> Ideal for a thorough refresh, especially after events or long intervals without professional cleaning.</li><li data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"865\"><strong data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"784\">Recurring Cleanings (Weekly/Monthly):</strong> Perfect for those who want a consistently tidy space at a <strong data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"862\">discounted rate</strong>.</li><li data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"974\"><strong data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"898\">Office / Commercial Plans:</strong> Tailored packages for businesses seeking regular upkeep of their workspace.</li></ul><p data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1062\">Feel free to <a href=\"#\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1004\">contact us</a> or explore our <a href=\"#\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1037\">Booking Page</a> to see detailed pricing.</p>\n															<svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"></path></svg>\n								<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M143 352.3L7 216.3c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l22.6-22.6c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l96.4 96.4 96.4-96.4c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l22.6 22.6c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9l-136 136c-9.2 9.4-24.4 9.4-33.8 0z\"></path></svg>\n												<a tabindex=\"0\">Why choose us and not others?</a>\n					<li data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1229\"><strong data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1154\">Trusted &amp; Certified Cleaners:</strong> Our cleaners undergo strict background checks and professional training.</li><li data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1331\"><strong data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1261\">Online Booking &amp; Payment:</strong> Effortlessly schedule appointments and pay online, reducing hassle.</li><li data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1451\"><strong data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1359\">Eco-Friendly Options:</strong> Choose sustainable cleaning products (optional) for an environmentally conscious service.</li><li data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1578\"><strong data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1480\">Flexible Rescheduling:</strong> Need to change your plans? We’ve got you covered with easy modification or cancellation policies.</li>\n															<svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"></path></svg>\n								<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M143 352.3L7 216.3c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l22.6-22.6c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l96.4 96.4 96.4-96.4c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l22.6 22.6c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9l-136 136c-9.2 9.4-24.4 9.4-33.8 0z\"></path></svg>\n												<a tabindex=\"0\">Should you trust professional cleaner?</a>\n					<p>Absolutely! Professional cleaners bring <strong data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1735\">expertise, efficiency, and attention to detail</strong>. At MyClean, all cleaners are <strong data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1801\">background-checked and verified</strong> to ensure safety and reliability. This means you can confidently leave the cleaning tasks to our pros and enjoy a spotless, comfortable space.</p>\n															<svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"></path></svg>\n								<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M143 352.3L7 216.3c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l22.6-22.6c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l96.4 96.4 96.4-96.4c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l22.6 22.6c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9l-136 136c-9.2 9.4-24.4 9.4-33.8 0z\"></path></svg>\n												<a tabindex=\"0\">Not happy with service & want to complain?</a>\n					<p>Your satisfaction is our top priority. If you’re not 100% happy, please <strong data-start=\"2086\" data-end=\"2114\">contact our support team</strong> within 24 hours of your appointment. We’ll work with you to <strong data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2197\">resolve any issues</strong>—whether through a <strong data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2233\">free re-clean</strong>, a <strong data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2249\">discount</strong>, or other suitable remedies—to ensure you get the service you deserve.</p>\n															<svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"></path></svg>\n								<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M143 352.3L7 216.3c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l22.6-22.6c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l96.4 96.4 96.4-96.4c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l22.6 22.6c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9l-136 136c-9.2 9.4-24.4 9.4-33.8 0z\"></path></svg>\n												<a tabindex=\"0\">Do we have good service record?</a>\n					<p data-start=\"2367\" data-end=\"2618\">Yes! We’re proud of our <strong data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2441\">high customer satisfaction rates</strong> and consistent <strong data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2478\">five-star reviews</strong>. You can check our <a data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2515\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"#\">Testimonials</a> page to see what other customers are saying, or feel free to ask our support team for more references.</p>\n															<svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"></path></svg>\n								<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M143 352.3L7 216.3c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l22.6-22.6c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l96.4 96.4 96.4-96.4c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l22.6 22.6c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9l-136 136c-9.2 9.4-24.4 9.4-33.8 0z\"></path></svg>\n												<a tabindex=\"0\">How to keep the cleaning task intact?</a>\n					<p data-start=\"2669\" data-end=\"2736\">To maintain the results of a professional cleaning:</p><ol data-start=\"2737\" data-end=\"3057\"><li data-start=\"2737\" data-end=\"2788\"><strong data-start=\"2740\" data-end=\"2757\">Tidy up daily</strong> to prevent clutter build-up.</li><li data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"2858\"><strong data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"2825\">Schedule regular appointments</strong> if you want consistent upkeep.</li><li data-start=\"2859\" data-end=\"2933\"><strong data-start=\"2862\" data-end=\"2889\">Store cleaning supplies</strong> in accessible places for quick touch-ups.</li><li data-start=\"2934\" data-end=\"3057\"><strong data-start=\"2937\" data-end=\"2952\">Communicate</strong> with your cleaner about any specific needs or ongoing issues, so they can address them in future visits.</li></ol>\n															<svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"></path></svg>\n								<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M143 352.3L7 216.3c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l22.6-22.6c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l96.4 96.4 96.4-96.4c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l22.6 22.6c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9l-136 136c-9.2 9.4-24.4 9.4-33.8 0z\"></path></svg>\n												<a tabindex=\"0\">How to get our service booking?</a>\n					<ol data-start=\"3116\" data-end=\"3367\"><li data-start=\"3116\" data-end=\"3155\"><strong data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3141\">Register or Log In</strong> to MyClean.</li><li data-start=\"3156\" data-end=\"3213\"><strong data-start=\"3159\" data-end=\"3186\">Choose a Service &amp; Time</strong> that fits your schedule.</li><li data-start=\"3214\" data-end=\"3282\"><strong data-start=\"3217\" data-end=\"3244\">Complete Secure Payment</strong> via Stripe, PayPal, or credit card.</li><li data-start=\"3283\" data-end=\"3367\"><strong data-start=\"3286\" data-end=\"3310\">Receive Confirmation</strong>—your cleaner will arrive on the scheduled date and time!</li></ol><p data-start=\"3369\" data-end=\"3470\">If you have any trouble booking online, you can also contact our <strong data-start=\"3434\" data-end=\"3454\">customer support</strong> for assistance.</p>\n					<h3>Your peace of mind</h3>				\n					<h3>starting  at just $30</h3>				\n					<a href=\"#\">\n									Book Now\n					</a>','FAQ','','publish','closed','closed','','faq','','','2025-03-07 00:48:04','2025-03-07 00:48:04','',0,'http://localhost/wordpress/?page_id=51',0,'page','',0),(52,1,'2025-03-06 11:28:52','2025-03-06 11:28:52','','FAQ','','inherit','closed','closed','','51-revision-v1','','','2025-03-06 11:28:52','2025-03-06 11:28:52','',51,'http://localhost/wordpress/?p=52',0,'revision','',0),(53,1,'2025-03-06 11:29:16','2025-03-06 11:29:16','','FAQ','','inherit','closed','closed','','51-revision-v1','','','2025-03-06 11:29:16','2025-03-06 11:29:16','',51,'http://localhost/wordpress/?p=53',0,'revision','',0),(54,1,'2025-03-06 11:29:33','2025-03-06 11:29:33','<h2>Terms &amp; Privacy – MyClean\n</h2>				\n					<h3>Terms of Service</h3>				\n		<p data-start=\"208\" data-end=\"350\">We strive to provide a <strong data-start=\"231\" data-end=\"280\">seamless and professional cleaning experience</strong>. By booking a service with <strong data-start=\"308\" data-end=\"319\">MyClean</strong>, you agree to the following:</p><ul data-start=\"352\" data-end=\"1022\"><li data-start=\"352\" data-end=\"481\"><strong data-start=\"354\" data-end=\"373\">Fair Use Policy</strong>: Users must provide <strong data-start=\"394\" data-end=\"422\">accurate booking details</strong> and ensure access to the premises at the scheduled time.</li><li data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"624\"><strong data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"525\">Booking Modifications &amp; Cancellations</strong>: Cancellations must be made <strong data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"577\">24 hours in advance</strong> to be eligible for a refund or rescheduling.</li><li data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"769\"><strong data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"648\">Payment &amp; Refunds</strong>: Payments are <strong data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"713\">securely processed online via Stripe or PayPal</strong>. Refunds are only provided under specific conditions.</li><li data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"906\"><strong data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"795\">Service Limitations</strong>: Our cleaners have the right to <strong data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"847\">decline service</strong> if an environment is deemed unsafe or outside our scope.</li><li data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"1022\"><strong data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"931\">Dispute Resolution</strong>: Any issues regarding the service must be reported within <strong data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1002\">24 hours</strong> after completion.</li></ul>		\n					<h3>Privacy Policy</h3>				\n		<p data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1259\">At <strong data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1173\">MyClean</strong>, we take data privacy seriously. Here’s how we manage and protect your information:</p><ul data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1905\"><li data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1515\"><p data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1290\"><strong data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1287\">What Data We Collect</strong>:</p><ul data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1515\"><li data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1381\">Your <strong data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1350\">name, contact details, and booking information</strong> when you schedule a service.</li><li data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1450\">Payment details (handled securely via third-party processors).</li><li data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1515\">Browsing data for website improvement and user experience.</li></ul></li><li data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1715\"><p data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1546\"><strong data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1543\">How We Use Your Data</strong>:</p><ul data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1715\"><li data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1599\">To <strong data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1587\">process bookings and payments</strong> securely.</li><li data-start=\"1602\" data-end=\"1656\">To <strong data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1629\">send notifications</strong> related to your service.</li><li data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1715\">To <strong data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1691\">enhance user experience</strong> and customer support.</li></ul></li><li data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1905\"><p data-start=\"1719\" data-end=\"1745\"><strong data-start=\"1719\" data-end=\"1742\">Third-Party Sharing</strong>:</p><ul data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1905\"><li data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1781\">We <strong data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1768\">DO NOT sell</strong> user data.</li><li data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1905\">Limited data is shared only with <strong data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1848\">trusted service providers</strong> (e.g., professional cleaners) for service fulfillment.</li></ul></li></ul>		\n					<h3>User Rights &amp; Security</h3>				\n		<ul><li data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2217\"><p data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2217\"><strong data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2106\">Data Protection</strong>: We comply with data protection laws (e.g., GDPR) and take <strong data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2188\">measures to secure</strong> your personal information.</p></li><li data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2418\"><p data-start=\"2220\" data-end=\"2238\"><strong data-start=\"2220\" data-end=\"2235\">Your Rights</strong>:</p><ul data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2418\"><li data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2303\">Request to <strong data-start=\"2254\" data-end=\"2281\">view, modify, or delete</strong> your personal data.</li><li data-start=\"2306\" data-end=\"2358\">Opt-out of <strong data-start=\"2319\" data-end=\"2347\">marketing communications</strong> anytime.</li><li data-start=\"2361\" data-end=\"2418\">Raise concerns or disputes regarding your data usage.</li></ul></li><li data-start=\"24