0,'revision','',0),(120,1,'2025-03-07 01:42:20','2025-03-07 01:42:20','','Terms &amp; Privacy','','inherit','closed','closed','','54-revision-v1','','','2025-03-07 01:42:20','2025-03-07 01:42:20','',54,'http://localhost/wordpress/?p=120',0,'revision','',0),(121,1,'2025-03-07 01:42:20','2025-03-07 01:42:20','<h2>Terms &amp; Privacy – MyClean\n</h2>				\n					<h3>Terms of Service</h3>				\n		<p data-start=\"208\" data-end=\"350\">We strive to provide a <strong data-start=\"231\" data-end=\"280\">seamless and professional cleaning experience</strong>. By booking a service with <strong data-start=\"308\" data-end=\"319\">MyClean</strong>, you agree to the following:</p><ul data-start=\"352\" data-end=\"1022\"><li data-start=\"352\" data-end=\"481\"><strong data-start=\"354\" data-end=\"373\">Fair Use Policy</strong>: Users must provide <strong data-start=\"394\" data-end=\"422\">accurate booking details</strong> and ensure access to the premises at the scheduled time.</li><li data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"624\"><strong data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"525\">Booking Modifications &amp; Cancellations</strong>: Cancellations must be made <strong data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"577\">24 hours in advance</strong> to be eligible for a refund or rescheduling.</li><li data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"769\"><strong data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"648\">Payment &amp; Refunds</strong>: Payments are <strong data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"713\">securely processed online via Stripe or PayPal</strong>. Refunds are only provided under specific conditions.</li><li data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"906\"><strong data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"795\">Service Limitations</strong>: Our cleaners have the right to <strong data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"847\">decline service</strong> if an environment is deemed unsafe or outside our scope.</li><li data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"1022\"><strong data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"931\">Dispute Resolution</strong>: Any issues regarding the service must be reported within <strong data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1002\">24 hours</strong> after completion.</li></ul>		\n					<h3>Privacy Policy</h3>				\n		<p data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1259\">At <strong data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1173\">MyClean</strong>, we take data privacy seriously. Here’s how we manage and protect your information:</p><ul data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1905\"><li data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1515\"><p data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1290\"><strong data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1287\">What Data We Collect</strong>:</p><ul data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1515\"><li data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1381\">Your <strong data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1350\">name, contact details, and booking information</strong> when you schedule a service.</li><li data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1450\">Payment details (handled securely via third-party processors).</li><li data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1515\">Browsing data for website improvement and user experience.</li></ul></li><li data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1715\"><p data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1546\"><strong data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1543\">How We Use Your Data</strong>:</p><ul data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1715\"><li data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1599\">To <strong data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1587\">process bookings and payments</strong> securely.</li><li data-start=\"1602\" data-end=\"1656\">To <strong data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1629\">send notifications</strong> related to your service.</li><li data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1715\">To <strong data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1691\">enhance user experience</strong> and customer support.</li></ul></li><li data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1905\"><p data-start=\"1719\" data-end=\"1745\"><strong data-start=\"1719\" data-end=\"1742\">Third-Party Sharing</strong>:</p><ul data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1905\"><li data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1781\">We <strong data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1768\">DO NOT sell</strong> user data.</li><li data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1905\">Limited data is shared only with <strong data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1848\">trusted service providers</strong> (e.g., professional cleaners) for service fulfillment.</li></ul></li></ul>		\n					<h3>User Rights &amp; Security</h3>				\n		<ul><li data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2217\"><p data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2217\"><strong data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2106\">Data Protection</strong>: We comply with data protection laws (e.g., GDPR) and take <strong data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2188\">measures to secure</strong> your personal information.</p></li><li data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2418\"><p data-start=\"2220\" data-end=\"2238\"><strong data-start=\"2220\" data-end=\"2235\">Your Rights</strong>:</p><ul data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2418\"><li data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2303\">Request to <strong data-start=\"2254\" data-end=\"2281\">view, modify, or delete</strong> your personal data.</li><li data-start=\"2306\" data-end=\"2358\">Opt-out of <strong data-start=\"2319\" data-end=\"2347\">marketing communications</strong> anytime.</li><li data-start=\"2361\" data-end=\"2418\">Raise concerns or disputes regarding your data usage.</li></ul></li><li data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2622\"><p data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2446\"><strong data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2443\">Security Measures</strong>:</p><ul data-start=\"2449\" data-end=\"2622\"><li data-start=\"2449\" data-end=\"2500\">Encrypted transactions for <strong data-start=\"2478\" data-end=\"2497\">secure payments</strong>.</li><li data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2559\">Regular system updates to <strong data-start=\"2531\" data-end=\"2556\">prevent data breaches</strong>.</li><li data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2622\">Strict access control for <strong data-start=\"2590\" data-end=\"2619\">authorized personnel only</strong>.</li></ul></li></ul>','Terms &amp; Privacy','','inherit','closed','closed','','54-revision-v1','','','2025-03-07 01:42:20','2025-03-07 01:42:20','',54,'http://localhost/wordpress/?p=121',0,'revision','',0),(122,1,'2025-03-07 02:21:04','2025-03-07 02:21:04','','Default Registration','','publish','closed','closed','','default-registration','','','2025-03-07 03:13:00','2025-03-07 03:13:00','',0,'http://localhost/wordpress/um_form/default-registration/',0,'um_form','',0),(123,1,'2025-03-07 02:21:04','2025-03-07 02:21:04','','Default Login','','publish','closed','closed','','default-login','','','2025-03-07 02:21:04','2025-03-07 02:21:04','',0,'http://localhost/wordpress/um_form/default-login/',0,'um_form','',0),(124,1,'2025-03-07 02:21:04','2025-03-07 02:21:04','','Default Profile','','publish','closed','closed','','default-profile','','','2025-03-07 02:21:04','2025-03-07 02:21:04','',0,'http://localhost/wordpress/um_form/default-profile/',0,'um_form','',0),(125,1,'2025-03-07 02:21:04','2025-03-07 02:21:04','','Members','','publish','closed','closed','','members','','','2025-03-07 02:21:04','2025-03-07 02:21:04','',0,'http://localhost/wordpress/?p=125',0,'um_directory','',0),(126,1,'2025-03-07 02:22:24','2025-03-07 02:22:24','[ultimatemember form_id=\"124\"]','User','','publish','closed','closed','','user','','','2025-04-13 04:37:37','2025-04-13 04:37:37','',0,'http://localhost/wordpress/user/',0,'page','',0),(127,1,'2025-03-07 02:22:24','2025-03-07 02:22:24','[ultimatemember form_id=\"123\"]','Login','','publish','closed','closed','','login','','','2025-03-10 10:42:21','2025-03-10 10:42:21','',0,'http://localhost/wordpress/login/',0,'page','',0),(128,1,'2025-03-07 02:22:24','2025-03-07 02:22:24','<h2>Register as Customer</h2>				\n					<h2>Looking for professional cleaning services to make your life easier? Register as a customer on our platform to enjoy efficient house cleaning booking services. Join now to make cleaning simple!</h2>				\n					<a href=\"http://localhost/wordpress/register-as-customer/\">\n									Become a customer\n					</a>\n					<h2>Register as Cleaner</h2>				\n					<h2>Welcome to join our cleaning team! Here, you w