or a healthier home and planet.</p>		\n					<a href=\"http://localhost/wordpress/booking-page/\">\n									Contact Now\n					</a>\n					<h3>We specialize In...</h3>				\n															<img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/nik-lanus-41808-unsplash-r2gkmrv13rlod0dxclqir3lh5fn5t61fv5r4c1xfu8.jpg\" title=\"nik-lanus-41808-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"nik-lanus-41808-unsplash.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h4>Eco-friendly cleaning</h4>				\n															<img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/abstract-blur-business-334979-r2gkmxi28rteao5qfo6a6268pqvd3cntvxo17pp2sw.jpg\" title=\"abstract-blur-business-334979.jpg\" alt=\"abstract-blur-business-334979.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h4>Closets</h4>				\n															<img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/bazaar-bottles-business-15964-r2gkn353ds148bxjiqm1l0r0a23kdja7wpky3dgprk.jpg\" title=\"bazaar-bottles-business-15964.jpg\" alt=\"bazaar-bottles-business-15964.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h4>Organization</h4>				\n															<img width=\"800\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/service-6.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/service-6.jpg 800w, http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/service-6-300x225.jpg 300w, http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/service-6-768x576.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />															\n					<h4>Kitchens</h4>				\n															<img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/bath-bathroom-bathtub-534116-r2gkncjha4dzgfjvzuob9ydm7wt8iibja03sw52s1c.jpg\" title=\"bath-bathroom-bathtub-534116.jpg\" alt=\"bath-bathroom-bathtub-534116.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h4>Bathrooms</h4>				\n															<img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumb