 and 100% satisfaction guarantee to make your life easier.Secure online payment via Stripe/PayPal, instant e-receipt provided.We offer green cleaning products for a healthier home and planet.</p>		\n					<a href=\"http://dev.my-clean.top/booking-page/\">\n									Contact Now\n					</a>\n					<h3>We specialize In...</h3>				\n															<img src=\"http://dev.my-clean.top/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/nik-lanus-41808-unsplash-r2gkmrv13rlod0dxclqir3lh5fn5t61fv5r4c1xfu8.jpg\" title=\"nik-lanus-41808-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"nik-lanus-41808-unsplash.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h4>Eco-friendly cleaning</h4>				\n															<img src=\"http://dev.my-clean.top/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/abstract-blur-business-334979-r2gkmxi28rteao5qfo6a6268pqvd3cntvxo17pp2sw.jpg\" title=\"abstract-blur-business-334979.jpg\" alt=\"abstract-blur-business-334979.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h4>Closets</h4>				\n															<img src=\"http://dev.my-clean.top/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/bazaar-bottles-business-15964-r2gkn353ds148bxjiqm1l0r0a23kdja7wpky3dgprk.jpg\" title=\"bazaar-bottles-business-15964.jpg\" alt=\"bazaar-bottles-business-15964.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h4>Organization</h4>				\n															<img width=\"800\" height=\"600\" src=\"http://dev.my-clean.top/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/service-6.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://dev.my-clean.top/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/service-6.jpg 800w, http://dev.my-clean.top/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/service-6-300x225.jpg 300w, http://dev.my-clean.top/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/service-6-768x576.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />															\n					<h4>Kitchens</h4>				\n															<img src=\"http://dev.my-clean.top/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/bath-bathroom-bathtub-534116-r2gkncjha4dzgfjvzuob9ydm7wt8iibja03sw52s1c.jpg\" title=\"bath-bathroom-bathtub-534116.jpg\" alt=\"bath-bathroom-bathtub-534116.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h4>Bathrooms</h4>				\n															<img src=\"http://dev.my-clean.top/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/close-up-equipment-hand-1321725-r2gknh8o8akf2hd28epg4f6x6u62kzu6ynd8aivt68.jpg\" title=\"close-up-equipment-hand-1321725.jpg\" alt=\"close-up-equipment-hand-1321725.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h4>Laundry</h4>				\n					<h3>Testimonials</h3>				\n					<a href=\"http://dev.my-clean.top/booking-page/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"></path></svg>			\n									Book Now\n					</a>\n							“MyClean made booking incredibly easy! My cleaner was punctual, friendly, and very thorough. My house feels brand new!”\n— Emily R., Cairns    \n“I love their eco-friendly cleaning option! It aligns perfectly with my environmental values, and the cleaning quality is exceptional.”\n— David S., Townsville\n							<img width=\"200\" height=\"200\" src=\"http://dev.my-clean.top/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/testimonial-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" />						\n														Simone Ackerman\n																						San Francisco','Welcome to  Professional Cleaning Services','','inherit','closed','closed','','9-revision-v1','','','2025-04-08 02:12:23','2025-04-08 02:12:23','',9,'https://myclean.168chinesetcw.com/?p=355',0,'revision','',0),(337,1,'2025-04-08 01:19:05','2025-04-08 01:19:05','<h1>About Us.</h1>				\n		<p>MyClean is on a mission to make quality cleaning services <strong data-start=\"217\" data-end=\"231\">accessible</strong>, <strong data-start=\"233\" data-end=\"247\">affordable</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"253\" data-end=\"268\">hassle-free</strong> for everyone. Whether you need a <strong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"325\">one-time deep clean</strong>, <strong data-start=\"327\" data-end=\"344\">weekly upkeep</strong>, or an <strong data-start=\"352\" data-end=\"368\">eco-friendly</strong> refresh of your home or office, we’ve got you covered.</p>		\n															<img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/clean-decoration-home-6412-r2gkmla0nqgs9b2djqm4ybs5elr5hornzowo758t08.jpg\" title=\"clean-decoration-home-6412.jpg\" alt=\"clean-decoration-home-6412.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h3>Fast, Friendly Service</h3>				\n		<p data-start=\"34\" data-end=\"307\">At <strong data-start=\"37\" data-end=\"48\">MyClean</strong>, we provide <strong data-start=\"61\" data-end=\"105\">efficient, professional, and hassle-free</strong> cleaning services to help you maintain a spotless and comfortable environment. Whether it’s for your home or office, our trained professionals ensure every space is cleaned with <strong data-start=\"284\" data-end=\"306\">care and precision</strong>.</p>		\n							<ul>\n							<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>						\n										Certified & Background-Checked Cleaners\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>						\n										Convenient & Flexible Booking\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" 