ntent/uploads/2025/03/icon-1.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Office Cleaning</h3><p>Reliable and professional cleaning for office spaces, ensuring a tidy and productive working environment for you and your team.</p>				\n								<figure><img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/clean-decoration-home-6412-r2gkmla5rxco3qnhf0w4rn98zqjlbabbi96pz4771s.jpg\" alt=\"clean-decoration-home-6412.jpg\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/bath-bathroom-bathtub-534116-r2gkncjha4dzgfjvzuob9ydm7wt8iibja03sw52s1c.jpg\" alt=\"bath-bathroom-bathtub-534116.jpg\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/nik-lanus-41808-unsplash-1-r2himx09obd0iy917qv806wfyhzyahsw63rscyvofk.jpg\" alt=\"nik-lanus-41808-unsplash-1.jpg\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/bazaar-bottles-business-15964-r2gkn353ds148bxjiqm1l0r0a23kdja7wpky3dgprk.jpg\" alt=\"bazaar-bottles-business-15964.jpg\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/abstract-blur-business-334979-r2gkmxi28rteao5qfo6a6268pqvd3cntvxo17pp2sw.jpg\" alt=\"abstract-blur-business-334979.jpg\" /></figure>			\n					<figure><img width=\"48\" height=\"60\" src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/icon-7.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Organization & Decluttering</h3><p>Professional organizing services to help declutter and optimize your storage spaces, improving efficiency and reducing stress.</p>				\n					<figure><img width=\"55\" height=\"60\" src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/icon-3.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3> Green Cleaning</h3><p>Environmentally friendly cleaning services using safe, biodegradable products to protect your home and our planet.</p>				\n					<figure><img width=\"57\" height=\"60\" src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/icon-6.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>LAUNDRY SERVICES</h3><p>Professional laundry care including washing, drying, folding, and ironing, giving you more time for the things you love.</p>','My Order','','inherit','closed','closed','','336-revision-v1','','','2025-04-08 01:19:05','2025-04-08 01:19:05','',336,'https://myclean.168chinesetcw.com/?p=337',0,'revision','',0),(338,1,'2025-04-08 01:19:51','2025-04-08 01:19:51','<h1>About Us.</h1>				\n		<p>MyClean is on a mission to make quality cleaning services <strong data-start=\"217\" data-end=\"231\">accessible</strong>, <strong data-start=\"233\" data-end=\"247\">affordable</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"253\" data-end=\"268\">hassle-free</strong> for everyone. Whether you need a <strong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"325\">one-time deep clean</strong>, <strong data-start=\"327\" data-end=\"344\">weekly upkeep</strong>, or an <strong data-start=\"352\" data-end=\"368\">eco-friendly</strong> refresh of your home or office, we’ve got you covered.</p>		\n															<img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/clean-decoration-home-6412-r2gkmla0nqgs9b2djqm4ybs5elr5hornzowo758t08.jpg\" title=\"clean-decoration-home-6412.jpg\" alt=\"clean-decoration-home-6412.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" />															\n					<h3>Fast, Friendly Service</h3>				\n		<p data-start=\"34\" data-end=\"307\">At <strong data-start=\"37\" data-end=\"48\">MyClean</strong>, we provide <strong data-start=\"61\" data-end=\"105\">efficient, professional, and hassle-free</strong> cleaning services to help you maintain a spotless and comfortable environment. Whether it’s for your home or office, our trained professionals ensure every space is cleaned with <strong data-start=\"284\" data-end=\"306\">care and precision</strong>.</p>		\n							<ul>\n							<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203