iness-15964-r2gkn353ds148bxjiqm1l0r0a23kdja7wpky3dgprk.jpg\" alt=\"bazaar-bottles-business-15964.jpg\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/abstract-blur-business-334979-r2gkmxi28rteao5qfo6a6268pqvd3cntvxo17pp2sw.jpg\" alt=\"abstract-blur-business-334979.jpg\" /></figure>			\n					<figure><img width=\"48\" height=\"60\" src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/icon-7.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Organization & Decluttering</h3><p>Professional organizing services to help declutter and optimize your storage spaces, improving efficiency and reducing stress.</p>				\n					<figure><img width=\"55\" height=\"60\" src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/icon-3.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3> Green Cleaning</h3><p>Environmentally friendly cleaning services using safe, biodegradable products to protect your home and our planet.</p>				\n					<figure><img width=\"57\" height=\"60\" src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/icon-6.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>LAUNDRY SERVICES</h3><p>Professional laundry care including washing, drying, folding, and ironing, giving you more time for the things you love.</p>','Chat','','publish','closed','closed','','chat','','','2025-04-12 02:05:22','2025-04-12 02:05:22','',0,'https://myclean.168chinesetcw.com/?page_id=398',0,'page','',0),(399,1,'2025-04-12 02:05:22','2025-04-12 02:05:22','<h1>About Us.</h1>				\n		<p>MyClean is on a mission to make quality cleaning services <strong data-start=\"217\" data-end=\"231\">accessible</strong>, <strong data-start=\"233\" data-end=\"247\">affordable</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"253\" data-end=\"268\">hassle-free</strong> for everyone. Whether you need a <strong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"325\">one-time deep clean</strong>, <strong data-start=\"327\" data-end=\"344\">weekly upkeep</strong>, or an <strong data-start=\"352\" data-end=\"368\">eco-friendly</strong> refresh of your home 